{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Another Where is a roguelike-inspired card adventure filled with mystery and strategic deck-building. Explore strange worlds, collect powerful cards, and adapt your tactics to survive ever-changing challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782550/extras/072bd37cf6aaabb958c7c6b4c3da0b08.avif?t=1763475014\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782550/extras_big/072bd37cf6aaabb958c7c6b4c3da0b08.avif?t=1763475014 width=800 height=532 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new card game called &quot;Another Where&quot; has been released in Borgochiaro. Now that you've grown up, it's time to start your adventure. Set off for Borgochiaro and challenge all the fans in exciting card games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along your way you will find some puzzles...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782550/extras/9a930ab394f9442ab42126522b8b9549.avif?t=1763475014\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782550/extras_big/9a930ab394f9442ab42126522b8b9549.avif?t=1763475014 width=800 height=1200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Heroes and Kaiju</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Steps in the Dark</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Robots and Aliens</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-West and Magic</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Myths and Legends</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Fairy Tales</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect lots of themed cards by opening expansion packs and collect unique cards during different events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a themed deck or mix cards from different expansions and create an even stronger deck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782550/extras/f3d31fe6d1dd35721c46e3f2c23bf380.avif?t=1763475014\" width=800 height=532 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat the six area bosses and get their medals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then become the new champion of Borgochiaro</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >by facing the strongest player. And why not, maybe even saving the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782550/extras/5dd4f9774cc8465151140d87b6de1ff6.avif?t=1763475014\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782550/extras_big/5dd4f9774cc8465151140d87b6de1ff6.avif?t=1763475014 width=800 height=800 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Princess","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3782550/dd2421207969d934450a57158f83cea78eed93f6.jpg"},{"name":"The Mayor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3782550/aab2b662efd7fa81e9d3bf4577a8da417a81640c.jpg"},{"name":"Do you believe in destiny?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3782550/5d775281937b1501ae90a84a8c8aa6f7b6f3749f.jpg"},{"name":"Stronger than the creator","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3782550/2ad9e3ceea7d33ba27e58bc02bfc509558964dde.jpg"},{"name":"Explore the quarry","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3782550/d30073b0ecfd96c8009fc44de0daa3b1ff976daa.jpg"},{"name":"A little vacation","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/stea